      "description": "The scene presents two women in a vertical split-screen composition, contrasting a bruised, distressed woman labeled 'black boyfriend' with a smiling, happy woman labeled 'white boyfriend'. The spatial arrangement emphasizes a direct visual comparison, implying a narrative of racialized gender violence where the Black woman is portrayed as a victim of abuse while the White woman is portrayed as happy and unharmed. The scene uses the visual contrast to reinforce a harmful stereotype.",
