      "label": "Anti-Black Stereotype: Aggressive/Violent Nature Claims",
      "description": "This stereotype, which claims Black people are inherently aggressive or violent, is implicitly referenced in the meme. The image of the bruised woman labeled 'black boyfriend' reinforces the false notion that Black men are more likely to be abusive, which is a dangerous and false generalization rooted in historical racism.",
