      "label": "White Savior Complex",
      "description": "The meme implicitly promotes the idea that White men are inherently kind and non-abusive, positioning the smiling White woman as the 'ideal' partner. This reinforces the harmful trope that White men are morally superior and that White women are the 'safe' choice, which is a form of racial and gendered privilege.",
